<title>UK: BGB Finance sets $300 mln bond due 2001.</title>
<headline>BGB Finance sets $300 mln bond due 2001.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Daiwa.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BGB FINANCE IRELAND PLC</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  BANKGESELLSCHAFT BERLIN AG</p>
<p> AMT    $300 MLN	COUPON     6.25	MATURITY    19.MAR.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.10    PAY DATE    19.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.225     REOFFER    100	 SPREAD	=</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AA1/=     LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> DENOMS (K) 10-100    SALE LIMITS US/UK/IE/DE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  MO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.125     SELL CONC  0.10	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
